{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "TAPP Composition Module: LaserAblation",
  "description": "The shared LaserAblation block of the 2026-08-11 TAPP library (Claude Skills for TAPP/Module_LaserAblation.csv), composed by 6 of the sixteen delivery tables. 29 owned fields over 22 schema paths.\n\nGENERATED by tools/build_module_bb.py from the module's CSV and its schema-path sidecar \u2014 edit those, not this file. Requiredness follows the TAPP tier matrix: a field Basic on a side is required there, Advanced is permitted, N/A is absent from that side entirely.\n\nThis is a PROFILE, not a vocabulary: it asserts which properties a conforming procedure or analysis carries. Column F (Example / Allowed Content) is consumer-owned per the module manifest, so no enum is pinned here \u2014 a consuming TAPP may narrow a value space, never widen it.",
  "$defs": {
    "ProcedureIdentification": {
